# Will the Circle Be Unbroken: Scruggs-style arrangement written fresh for this app.
# Melody in quarter notes on strings 2–4, inside alternating-thumb and forward-reverse rolls.
m0  G          lick:pickup              | 4:0T* 2:0I |
m1  G          alternating-thumb        | 3:0T* 2:0I 3:0T* 1:0M 3:0T* 2:0I 3:2T* 1:0M |
m2  G          lick:2nd-string-melody   | 2:0I* 1:0M 2:0T* 1:0M 2:0I* 5:0T 1:0M 5:0T |
m3  C G@5      lick:2nd-string-melody   | 2:1I* 1:2M 2:1T* 1:2M 2:0I* 5:0T 3:0I* 1:0M |
m4  D          forward-reverse          | 3:2T* 2:3I 1:4M 5:0T 1:4M 2:3I 4:0T* 1:4M |
m5  G          alternating-thumb        | 3:0T* 2:0I 3:0T* 1:0M 3:0T* 2:0I 3:2T* 1:0M |
m6  G          lick:2nd-string-melody   | 2:0I* 1:0M 2:0T* 1:0M 2:0I* 5:0T 1:0M 5:0T |
m7  D D7@5     lick:3rd-string-melody   | 3:2I* 1:4M 3:2T* 2:3I 3:4T* 2:1I 3:2T* 1:0M |
m8  G          tag !end                 | 3:0T* 2:0I [5:0T,1:0M] - - - |
